# Dark Cloud, the whole story by script (dc.exe --cheat-script, see docs/CHEATS.md "Scripted runs").
# Frame 3400 is when this run's --pad-script had reached Norune's free walk from an early save (any Norune save
# works: start the commands once the game is in Norune). Each command waits its turn and for an idle game.
# Checked headless (2026-11-28): every boss below beaten through the game's own death and defeat scenes, the
# ending, the credits and the cleared save, twice, each milestone within about 50 frames of the other run.
# One continuous run from an early Norune save to the ending: each boss's fight started by its own trigger, each
# boss defeated through the game's own death path (kill), each defeat scene left to set the story (until ...).
# Allies join as their scenes give them (party); the temple's signet doors as they set their flags (26, 27).
3400 talk 1
3400 cheat nodamage 1
3400 cheat health 1
3400 where
# 1. Divine Beast Cave: Dran
3400 party 2
3400 dungeon 0 15
3400 wait 300
3400 event 500
3400 kill
3400 until intflag 0 100
3400 wait 1800
3400 where
# 2. Wise Owl Forest: Master Utan
3400 party 3
3400 dungeon 1 17
3400 wait 300
3400 event 500
3400 kill
3400 until flag 34
3400 wait 1800
3400 where
# 3. The Shipwreck: La Saia (the floor's own scene in Area s34 first)
3400 party 4
3400 dungeon 2 18
3400 kill
3400 until intflag 0 300
3400 wait 1800
3400 where
# 4. The Sun & Moon Temple: King's Curse (both signet doors opened)
3400 party 5
3400 flag 26 1
3400 flag 27 1
3400 dungeon 3 18
3400 wait 300
3400 event 403
3400 kill
3400 until intflag 0 400
3400 wait 1800
3400 where
# 5. The Moon Sea: Minotaur Joe
3400 party 6
3400 dungeon 4 15
3400 wait 300
3400 event 500
3400 kill
3400 until intflag 0 500
3400 wait 1800
3400 where
# 6. The Gallery of Time: the Dark Genie, then the ending
3400 dungeon 5 25
3400 kill
3400 kill
3400 wait 600
3400 kill
3400 wait 600
3400 kill
3400 until flag 41
3400 where
# The ending and the credits, then the game's own "save cleared data?": Yes, the card, the save.
3400 wait 30000
3400 where
3400 press cross 4
3400 wait 240
3400 press cross 4
3400 wait 240
3400 press cross 4
3400 wait 240
3400 press cross 4
3400 wait 900
3400 where
3400 wait 3000
3400 where
